  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4112501",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Jack",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411250101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411250101": {
            "id": "411250101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "*sigh* If only I could go check it out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250102"
            ]
          },
          "411250102": {
            "id": "411250102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250103"
            ]
          },
          "411250103": {
            "id": "411250103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Ah, it's you. Well, it's not like anything special happened...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250104"
            ]
          },
          "411250104": {
            "id": "411250104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Hmm. No, I suppose this is actually quite special...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250106",
              "411250109"
            ]
          },
          "411250106": {
            "id": "411250106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Yes! You must have seen them too, right? They've been falling from the sky for a while now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250107"
            ]
          },
          "411250107": {
            "id": "411250107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Thanks to the Anemo God's protection... or maybe just blind good luck, none of them have hit the city so far.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250113"
            ]
          },
          "411250113": {
            "id": "411250113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "But quite a few have landed outside the city, and they say that whoever touches one of those meteorites will fall into a deep sleep... a kind of slumber that no one can wake them up from.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250114"
            ]
          },
          "411250114": {
            "id": "411250114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Cyrus has already gathered and commissioned quite a few adventurers. Some were sent to inform those still out there in the wild to seek shelter in the city...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250115"
            ]
          },
          "411250115": {
            "id": "411250115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "The others were to help the Knights of Favonius ascertain the positions of the fallen meteorites...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250116"
            ]
          },
          "411250116": {
            "id": "411250116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "And perform search and rescue operations around those meteorites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250117"
            ]
          },
          "411250117": {
            "id": "411250117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "As for me, Cyrus said that I'd best stay in the city and help to take care of those who've fallen unconscious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250118"
            ]
          },
          "411250118": {
            "id": "411250118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Maybe it's because my skills aren't up to par yet... But if I'm always stuck with these small tasks, I'll never get the chance to become stronger.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250119"
            ]
          },
          "411250119": {
            "id": "411250119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "*sigh* Regardless, I have to do what I've been assigned to do, and do it well... Still, can I ask you for a favor, Traveler?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250120"
            ]
          },
          "411250120": {
            "id": "411250120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "I'd like you to help me go out there and gather some information regarding those meteorites..."
          },
          "411250109": {
            "id": "411250109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "What!? The Good Hunter's having a promotion today? How did I not hear about that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250110"
            ]
          },
          "411250110": {
            "id": "411250110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Uh, no, wait! That's not what I wanted to talk about...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250111"
            ]
          },
          "411250111": {
            "id": "411250111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "So, meteorites have been raining down from the sky lately. I'm sure you've seen them too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250112"
            ]
          },
          "411250112": {
            "id": "411250112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Thanks to the Anemo God's protection... or maybe just blind good luck, none of them have hit the city so far."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112502",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411250201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411250201": {
            "id": "411250201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Well, looks like I've shaken them off for now. Still, what on earth is going on here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250202"
            ]
          },
          "411250202": {
            "id": "411250202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Did you come to investigate the meteorites?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250203"
            ]
          },
          "411250203": {
            "id": "411250203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Yes, I did. Took a commission from the Guild and all to investigate matters related to the meteorites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250204"
            ]
          },
          "411250204": {
            "id": "411250204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "But monsters near the spots where meteorites have landed have starting acting up all of a sudden.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250205"
            ]
          },
          "411250205": {
            "id": "411250205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Their strength, movements, and a whole host of other things are totally abnormal, and there's more of them than you usually see, as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250206"
            ]
          },
          "411250206": {
            "id": "411250206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "I was discovered, and didn't dare stay in the area, and so I took a few lesser-tread paths to shake them off my trail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250207"
            ]
          },
          "411250207": {
            "id": "411250207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "I have to report these abnormalities to Cyrus as soon as possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250208"
            ]
          },
          "411250208": {
            "id": "411250208",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is there anything else of note?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250209"
            ]
          },
          "411250209": {
            "id": "411250209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Anything else? Well, if I had to say it, it's that quite a few scholars are refusing to return to the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250210"
            ]
          },
          "411250210": {
            "id": "411250210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "No matter how hard I tried to convince them, they insisted on continuing their research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250211"
            ]
          },
          "411250211": {
            "id": "411250211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "There aren't enough of us adventurers out here either, so we can't simply send them reminders every few days...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250212"
            ]
          },
          "411250212": {
            "id": "411250212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "This is such a headache...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250213"
            ]
          },
          "411250213": {
            "id": "411250213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Well, Traveler, if there's nothing else, you should be seeking shelter in the city too. We haven't the time to be dallying out here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112503",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411250301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411250301": {
            "id": "411250301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "You're back. Did you discover anything?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112504",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411250401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411250401": {
            "id": "411250401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It seems like the monsters nearby have become way more active, and they don't look the same either..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112506",
      "subQuestName": "Investigate the Whispering Woods",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411250601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411250601": {
            "id": "411250601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "*sigh* I wonder if I'll be able to convince Cyrus...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250602"
            ]
          },
          "411250602": {
            "id": "411250602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why do you want to join the outdoor investigation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250603"
            ]
          },
          "411250603": {
            "id": "411250603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Well, um... I mean, you have to take part in important jobs to prove your worth, you know? That's what I think, at least...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250604"
            ]
          },
          "411250604": {
            "id": "411250604",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But if you mess up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250605"
            ]
          },
          "411250605": {
            "id": "411250605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Hey! I haven't done anything yet! Don't jinx me!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112509",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411250901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411250901": {
            "id": "411250901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The monsters seem to be somewhat abnormal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250902"
            ]
          },
          "411250902": {
            "id": "411250902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Abnormal? Perhaps it's the influence of the meteorites, then... Still, I suspect that someone has reported this already.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411250903"
            ]
          },
          "411250903": {
            "id": "411250903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Besides, I have trouble taking on normal monsters. As for these abnormal ones... the less said the better."
          }
        }
      }
    },
